# TOEIC Vocabulary Day55

| 단어 | 의미 | 예문 |
|---|---|---|
| postpone | 연기하다 | The meeting was postponed. |
| resume | 재개하다 | The service will resume tomorrow. |
| comply | 준수하다 | Employees must comply with the policy. |
| permit | 허가하다 | The building permits visitors to enter. |
| prohibit | 금지하다 | Smoking is prohibited inside the building. |
| verify | 확인하다 | Please verify your personal information. |
| ensure | 보장하다 | We must ensure customer safety. |
| inspect | 점검하다 | Technicians inspect the equipment. |
| notify | 알리다 | We will notify you of any changes. |
| resolve | 해결하다 | The staff resolved the problem quickly. |

### 암기 포인트

- comply with rules: 규칙을 준수하다
- be prohibited: 금지되다
- verify information: 정보를 확인하다
- ensure safety: 안전을 보장하다
- resolve a problem: 문제를 해결하다
- resume service: 서비스를 재개하다
